    "name": "glyhub_GPST000381_N_Prosaposin",
    "accession": "GPST000381",
    "glycan_type": "N",
    "title": "Released N-glycans of pSAP65 and pSAP75 prosaposin forms",
    "description": "Relative N-glycan profiles of two prosaposin forms in a study of hyperglycosylation and tumor dendritic-cell immune escape. The author-aligned expression table contains 36 features and two profile observations.",
    "details": "The quantitative assay is the complete Relative expression block (I:J), using its pSAP65 and pSAP75 column labels. The separate intensity blocks B and E carry contradictory pSAP labels: their relative values match expression columns J and I, respectively. The expression-block labels are adopted for this dataset; this is a curation choice, not an author-issued correction. The complete workbook and original labels remain available. Source expression values are fractions that sum to one per observed profile; they are not multiplied by 100. Blank cells remain missing. The source does not identify biological or technical replication for these two profiles, so replicate type is unknown.",
    "annotation": "Composition counts are directly transcribed from the author Sugar Composition block; NeuAc and NeuGc are distinguished. No glycan structure is inferred from composition or mass.",
    "doi": "10.1126/science.adg1955",
